@api = http://localhost:8000
@key =

### Real-time inference
POST {{api}}/v1/predict
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"text":"Please refund the duplicate payment on my invoice","channel":"email","language":"en"}

### Batch inference
POST {{api}}/v1/batch
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"tickets":[{"text":"The app crashes on upload"},{"text":"I cannot sign in to my account"}]}

### Replace event_id with an ID returned above; external_id is an idempotency key
POST {{api}}/v1/labels
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"event_id":"REPLACE","label":"billing","source":"human-adjudicated","external_id":"crm-label-001"}

### Human feedback does not become an adjudicated label
POST {{api}}/v1/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"event_id":"REPLACE","corrected_label":"billing","comment":"Customer confirmed duplicate charge","external_id":"review-001"}

### Metrics and incidents
GET {{api}}/v1/metrics
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Incidents (aggregate scope by default)
GET {{api}}/v1/incidents
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Model rollback
POST {{api}}/v1/deployments
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{"model_version":"router-v1","reason":"Rollback after quality regression"}
